# It Doesn't Add Up: "Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Suspect it." (CR 115.1, 400.3, 701.60a). Bot1's graveyard holds a Memnite (a creature card) and a
# Black Lotus (not a creature card), and Bot2's graveyard holds a Memnite too. Casting at Bot1's Lotus or at Bot2's Memnite is refused; Bot1's own Memnite is the positive control: it
# comes back untapped under Bot1's control and is suspected (menace, can't block), and Bot2's Memnite stays where it was.

